        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "とある洋館",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-4:caption",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "JIFの出演者を追加できないかと相談が来ています。\n例の投票枠で、上位に入っている事務所だそうです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "部下"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……資料を見せて。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しまった！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "雷皇"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "行け、タケル！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はぁああああっ！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "先日行われたイベントの映像です。\nこちらはTHE 虎牙道というユニットだそうです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "部下"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へえ、雷皇に一発お見舞いしたの。それじゃ、\nあの男が応援する気持ちも分からなくはないわね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（とはいえ……。そもそも、\nアイドルという存在に将来性はあるのかしら？）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（どんな事務所やアイドルが出てきても、結局は\n同じような規模、売り上げに収まる印象があるわ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（この頭打ちな業界より、もっと未来が見込める\n業界に出資するべきだと考えていたけれど……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……この事務所にいるアイドルユニット、\nどれでもいいわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うちがお金を出してる歌番組があったでしょう。\nそこに呼んで。番組で見極めるわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "315プロダクションのJIF出演と、\n『アイドル』ってものを。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_a:step-32:text",
        "step_id": 32,
        "step_index": 31,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 31
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……意地悪なことするなぁ。あの番組、最近\n視聴率が悪くて現場の空気も最悪らしいのに……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "部下"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
